########## mainnet ##########
CommitOnce — how long is a blockhash actually valid?
  rpc      https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
  version  4.3.0-rc.0

  blockhash        JDpYWKtxELxJ1MS5nMbB9Siwe1BQNL2ZciTcBfmps8vJ
  start slot       449861258
  lastValidHeight  427901548

  polling isBlockhashValid every second...

  valid for        40.1s  (145 slots, 3.62 slots/s)
  invalid after    24s of polling

  the program requires MIN_RETENTION_SECONDS = 3600 (one hour).
  measured margin  90x the observed window

  The docs state "roughly MAX_PROCESSING_AGE slots ~= 40s" and a "95x" margin,
  both derived from constants rather than measured. Compare them with the above.

